# Wordlist template for guard_no_provenance_leak.py.
#
# Copy this to .provenance-terms and keep THAT file out of version control.
# This example is committed; your real list must not be, because a public file
# listing the names you are keeping out of public view defeats the point.
#
# One term per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored. Each entry is
# matched case-insensitively as a whole word, so a term will not fire on a
# longer word that merely contains it.
#
# Real entries are the proper nouns you must not publish: employers, clients,
# internal system names, private repo names, project codenames.

Acme
Northwind
